{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a5e99aa9dc5a833d954d","chatId":"2be9a0e5c7014f1eb06180c2ddc4287f","sessionId":null,"userId":98989,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":938,"promptTokens":427,"completionTokens":94,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:29"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0046074625027146925,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5e99aa9dc5a833d954b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483689406,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a5e99aa9dc5a833d954b","chatId":"2be9a0e5c7014f1eb06180c2ddc4287f","sessionId":null,"userId":98989,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n我的妹妹珍妮特一直在等她的暗恋对象丹尼尔邀请她去参加舞会。昨天，她无意中听到了丹尼尔说自己对邀请她去舞会感到很紧张。然而，作为丹尼尔的好朋友，我知道他实际上打算邀请他的童年朋友丽莎，他知道丽莎会同意。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，丹尼尔最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 期待\nB) 伤心\nC) 感激\nD) 伤感\nE) 尴尬\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n丹尼尔为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他知道他的舞会对象会答应他的邀请\nB) 他对拒绝好朋友的妹妹感到糟糕\nC) 他知道邀请珍妮特会被拒绝\nD) 他感激我没有告诉珍妮特他的计划","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0046074625027146925,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5e99aa9dc5a833d954d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483689403,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9270bcf73b5f475d92f064f222f7c103"}